## 24. ADDON LIFECYCLE

Implement:

### Discovery
Find available addons and read manifests.

### Validation
Check compatibility, manifest validity, and dependencies.

### Installation
Register resources and models, synchronize schema, install owned data, register views/actions/menus, and activate the addon.

### Enable
Activate supported runtime capabilities.

### Disable
Prevent normal addon execution without destructive data removal.

### Upgrade
Refresh definitions, synchronize ORM schema, run applicable exceptional data hooks, and rebuild dependent registries.

### Uninstall
Remove addon-owned registrations and resources according to dependency and retention policies.

### Recovery
Handle failed operations without leaving inconsistent platform state.

